      "name": "Bloatuba",
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "printedParagraph": "When the Bloatuba enters the field, you may Chain from your hand. A target opponent reveals a number of cards from the top of the deck equal to the base power of the Chained manifestation. If they can, the opponent chooses and puts into stalemate a manifestation among those cards, then you reorder the remaining cards and the opponent puts them at the bottom of their deck in the order established by you.",
