      "expectedBehavior": "Offer the optional entry Chain. Reveal top cards equal to the Chained Manifestation’s base power. The opponent puts one revealed Manifestation into Stalemate if possible; the controller orders every remaining occurrence on the bottom. Respect Deck-exit replacements, choice actors, stale snapshots and unchanged in-Deck identities.",
